/* Android phone */
"Use Kongi on your Android phone" = "在 Android 手機上使用 Kongi";
"See sessions, approve requests and send prompts from the Kongi app while your phone is on the same Wi-Fi as this Mac. Everything is encrypted with a key only your phone and Mac know." = "手機與這台 Mac 連接同一個 Wi-Fi 時，可以在 Kongi App 中查看工作階段、核准請求和傳送訊息。所有內容都以只有手機和 Mac 知道的金鑰加密。";
